msgstr "अहाँक पास फाइल केँ पढ़बाक अथवा फोल्डर खोलबाक अनुमति नहि हाएत."

#: kio/global.cpp:547
msgid "Cannot Open Resource For Writing"
msgstr "लिखबा क' लेल संसाधन खोलि नहि सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:548
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This means that the file, <strong>%1</strong>, could not be written to as "
"requested, because access with permission to write could not be obtained."
msgstr ""
"एकर अर्थ अछि जे फाइल  <strong>%1</strong> जहिना जे निवेदित अछि लिखल नहि जाए सकल "
"किएक लिखबाक पहुँच अनुमतिसभ प्राप्त नहि भेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:556
#, kde-format
msgid "Cannot Initiate the %1 Protocol"
msgstr "प्रोटोकाल %1  प्रारंभ नहि कए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:557
msgid "Unable to Launch Process"
msgstr "प्रक्रिया चलाबै मे अक्षम"

#: kio/global.cpp:558
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol could not be started. This is usually due to technical "
"reasons."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:561
msgid ""
"The program which provides compatibility with this protocol may not have "
"been updated with your last update of KDE. This can cause the program to be "
"incompatible with the current version and thus not start."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:569
msgid "Internal Error"
msgstr "आंतरिक त्रुटि"

#: kio/global.cpp:570
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol has reported an internal error."
msgstr ""
"अहाँक कम्प्यूटर पर प्रोग्राम जे <strong>%1</strong> प्रोटोकाल केँ एक्सेस प्रदान करैत अछि ओ "
"एकटा आंतरिक त्रुटि कए रपट देलक."

#: kio/global.cpp:578
msgid "Improperly Formatted URL"
msgstr "गलत फार्मेटेड यूआरएल"

#: kio/global.cpp:579
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</"
"strong>ocator (URL) that you entered was not properly formatted. The format "
"of a URL is generally as follows:<blockquote><strong>protocol://user:"
"password@www.example.org:port/folder/filename.extension?query=value</"
"strong></blockquote>"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:588
#, kde-format
msgid "Unsupported Protocol %1"
msgstr "असमर्थित प्रोटोकाल %1"

#: kio/global.cpp:589
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The protocol <strong>%1</strong> is not supported by the KDE programs "
"currently installed on this computer."
msgstr ""
"प्रोटोकाल <strong>%1</strong> वर्तमान मे एहि कम्प्यूटर पर स्थापित केडीई प्रोग्राम "
"द्वारा समर्थित नहि अछि. "

#: kio/global.cpp:592
msgid "The requested protocol may not be supported."
msgstr "निवेदित प्रोटोकाल साइत समर्थित नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:593
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The versions of the %1 protocol supported by this computer and the server "
"may be incompatible."
msgstr ""
"प्रोटोकाल  %1 क' संस्करण जे एहि कम्प्यूटर आओर सर्वर द्वारा समर्थित अछि, साइत असंगत अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:595
msgid ""
"You may perform a search on the Internet for a KDE program (called a "
"kioslave or ioslave) which supports this protocol. Places to search include "
"<a href=\"http://kde-apps.org/\">http://kde-apps.org/</a> and <a href="
"\"http://freshmeat.net/\">http://freshmeat.net/</a>."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:604
msgid "URL Does Not Refer to a Resource."
msgstr "यूआरएल संसाधन केँ रेफर नहि करत."

#: kio/global.cpp:605
msgid "Protocol is a Filter Protocol"
msgstr "प्रोटोकाल एकटा फिल्टर प्रोटोकाल अछि"

#: kio/global.cpp:606
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</"
"strong>ocator (URL) that you entered did not refer to a specific resource."
msgstr ""
" <strong>यू</strong> <strong>आर</strong> <strong>एल</strong> (यूनिफ़ार्म संसाधन "
"लोकेटर) जे अहाँ भरल अछि ओ केओ विशिष्ट संसाधन केँ संदर्भित नहि करैत अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:609
msgid ""
"KDE is able to communicate through a protocol within a protocol; the "
"protocol specified is only for use in such situations, however this is not "
"one of these situations. This is a rare event, and is likely to indicate a "
"programming error."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:617
#, kde-format
msgid "Unsupported Action: %1"
msgstr "असमर्थित क्रिया: %1"

#: kio/global.cpp:618
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The requested action is not supported by the KDE program which is "
"implementing the <strong>%1</strong> protocol."
msgstr ""
"निवेदित क्रिया केडीई प्रोग्राम केर द्वारा समर्थित नहि अछि जे <strong>%1</strong> "
"प्रोटोकाल केँ लागू करैत अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:621
msgid ""
"This error is very much dependent on the KDE program. The additional "
"information should give you more information than is available to the KDE "
"input/output architecture."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:624
msgid "Attempt to find another way to accomplish the same outcome."
msgstr "वहिना परिणाम पूरा करब क' लेल आन रास्ता ढूंढने की कोसिस."

#: kio/global.cpp:629
msgid "File Expected"
msgstr "फाइल प्रत्याशित"

#: kio/global.cpp:630
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The request expected a file, however the folder <strong>%1</strong> was "
"found instead."
msgstr "निवेदन मे फाइल वांछित अछि. पर बदलामे फोल्डर <strong>%1</strong> पाएल गेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:632
msgid "This may be an error on the server side."
msgstr "ई सर्वरक एकटा त्रुटि भ' सकैत अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:637
msgid "Folder Expected"
msgstr "फोल्डर प्रत्याशित"

#: kio/global.cpp:638
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The request expected a folder, however the file <strong>%1</strong> was "
"found instead."
msgstr "निवेदन मे फोल्डर वांछित अछि. पर बदलामे फाइल <strong>%1</strong> पाएल गेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:645
msgid "File or Folder Does Not Exist"
msgstr "फाइल अथवा फोल्डर अस्तित्व मे नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:646
#, kde-format
msgid "The specified file or folder <strong>%1</strong> does not exist."
msgstr "उल्लेखित फाइल अथवा फोल्डर <strong>%1</strong> मोजुद नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:654
msgid ""
"The requested file could not be created because a file with the same name "
"already exists."
msgstr ""
"निवेदित फाइल तैआर नहि कएल जाए सकल किएक इएह नामक एकटा फाइल पहिने सँ उपलब्ध अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:656
msgid "Try moving the current file out of the way first, and then try again."
msgstr "मोजुदा फाइल केँ पहिने रस्ता सँ बाहर घसकएबाक कोसिस करू, फिनु फिनु सँ कोसिस करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:658
msgid "Delete the current file and try again."
msgstr "मोजुदा फाइल मेटाकए फिनु सँ  कोसिस करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:659
msgid "Choose an alternate filename for the new file."
msgstr "नवीन फाइल क' लेल वैकल्पिक नाम चुनू."

#: kio/global.cpp:664
msgid ""
"The requested folder could not be created because a folder with the same "
"name already exists."
msgstr ""
"निवेदित फोल्डर तैआर नहि कएल जाए सकल किएक इएह नाम क' एकटा फोल्डर पहिने सँ उपलब्ध अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:666
msgid "Try moving the current folder out of the way first, and then try again."
msgstr "मोजुदा फोल्डर केँ पहिने रास्ते सँ बाहर घसकएबाक कोसिस करू, फिनु सँ कोसिस करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:668
msgid "Delete the current folder and try again."
msgstr "मोजुदा फोल्डर मेटाकए फिनु सँ कोसिस करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:669
msgid "Choose an alternate name for the new folder."
msgstr "नवीन फोल्डर क' लेल वैकल्पिक नाम चुनू."

#: kio/global.cpp:673
msgid "Unknown Host"
msgstr "अनचिन्ह होस्ट"

#: kio/global.cpp:674
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An unknown host error indicates that the server with the requested name, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"एकटा अनचिन्ह होस्ट त्रुटि दर्शाबैछ जे निवेदित नाम क' सर्वर, <strong>%1</strong>, "
"इंटरनेट पर पता नहि लगाएल जाए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:677
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The name that you typed, %1, may not exist: it may be incorrectly typed."
msgstr ""
"जे नाम अहाँ टाइप कएल अछि. %1, साइत अस्तित्व मे नहि अछि. अथवा साइत गलत टाइप कएल गेल "
"अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:684
msgid "Access Denied"
msgstr "पहुँच अस्वीकृत"

#: kio/global.cpp:685
#, kde-format
msgid "Access was denied to the specified resource, <strong>%1</strong>."
msgstr "उल्लेखित संसाधन <strong>%1</strong> मे पहुँच नकार देल गेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:687 kio/global.cpp:903
msgid "You may have supplied incorrect authentication details or none at all."
msgstr "अहाँ गलत अनुमोदन विवरण देल अछि अथवा फिनु देल नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:689 kio/global.cpp:905
msgid "Your account may not have permission to access the specified resource."
msgstr "उल्लेखित संसाधन पर पहूँच क' लेल अहाँक अकाउन्ट मे साइत अनुमति नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:691 kio/global.cpp:907 kio/global.cpp:919
msgid ""
"Retry the request and ensure your authentication details are entered "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"निवेदन फिनु सँ  कोसिस करू आओर ई सुनिश्चित करू जे अहाँक अनुमोदन विवरण उचित प्रकार भरल "
"अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:697
msgid "Write Access Denied"
msgstr "लिखबाक पहुँच अस्वीकृत"

#: kio/global.cpp:698
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to write to the file <strong>%1</strong> was "
"rejected."
msgstr ""
"एकर अर्थ अछि जे फाइल  <strong>%1</strong> पर लिखबाक कोसिस अस्वीकृत कए देल गेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:705
msgid "Unable to Enter Folder"
msgstr "फोल्डर मे जएबामे अक्षम."

#: kio/global.cpp:706
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to enter (in other words, to open) the requested "
"folder <strong>%1</strong> was rejected."
msgstr ""
"एकर अर्थ अछि जे फोल्डर <strong>%1</strong> पर जएबाक (आन शब्दसभमे, खोलबा) कोसिस "
"अस्वीकृत कए देल गेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:714
msgid "Folder Listing Unavailable"
msgstr "फोल्डर सूची अनुपलब्ध"

#: kio/global.cpp:715
#, kde-format
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filesystem"
msgstr "प्रोटोकाल %1 फाइलसिस्टम नहि अछि"

#: kio/global.cpp:716
msgid ""
"This means that a request was made which requires determining the contents "
"of the folder, and the KDE program supporting this protocol is unable to do "
"so."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:724
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected"
msgstr "साइक्लिक लिंक पता लागल"

#: kio/global.cpp:725
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or folder to a separate "
"name and/or location. KDE detected a link or series of links that results in "
"an infinite loop - i.e. the file was (perhaps in a roundabout way) linked to "
"itself."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:729 kio/global.cpp:751
msgid ""
"Delete one part of the loop in order that it does not cause an infinite "
"loop, and try again."
msgstr ""
"लूप केर एकटा भाग केँ मेटाबू जकरासँ जे ई अनंत लूप नहि बनाबै कए कारण नहि बनै, आओर फिनु "
"कोसिस करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:738
msgid "Request Aborted By User"
msgstr "प्रयोक्ता द्वारा निवेदन रोका गेल"

#: kio/global.cpp:739 kio/global.cpp:1040
msgid "The request was not completed because it was aborted."
msgstr "निवेदन पूरा नहि कएल जाए सकल किएक एकरा रोकि देल गेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:741 kio/global.cpp:935 kio/global.cpp:1042
msgid "Retry the request."
msgstr "निवेदन केँ फिनु सँ  कोसिस करू"

#: kio/global.cpp:745
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected During Copy"
msgstr "नकल केर दौरान साइक्लिक लिंक पता लागल"

#: kio/global.cpp:746
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or folder to a separate "
"name and/or location. During the requested copy operation, KDE detected a "
"link or series of links that results in an infinite loop - i.e. the file was "
"(perhaps in a roundabout way) linked to itself."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:756
msgid "Could Not Create Network Connection"
msgstr "नेटवर्क कनेक्शन तैआर नहि कए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:757
msgid "Could Not Create Socket"
msgstr "साकेट तैआर नहि कए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:758
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be created."
msgstr ""
"ई पूरे तकनीकी त्रुटि अछि जकरामे नेटवर्क कम्यूनिकेशन (साकेट) क' लेल वांछित अओजार बनाएल नहि "
"जाए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:760 kio/global.cpp:873 kio/global.cpp:884 kio/global.cpp:893
msgid ""
"The network connection may be incorrectly configured, or the network "
"interface may not be enabled."
msgstr "नेटवर्क कनेक्शन साइत बिन्यस्त नहि अछि, अथवा नेटवर्क इंटरफेस सक्षम नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:766
msgid "Connection to Server Refused"
msgstr "सर्वर सँ कनेक्शन अस्वीकृत"

#: kio/global.cpp:767
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The server <strong>%1</strong> refused to allow this computer to make a "
"connection."
msgstr "सर्वर <strong>%1</strong> एहि कम्प्यूटर केँ कनेक्शन करबाक स्वीकृति नहि देलक."

#: kio/global.cpp:769
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be configured "
"to allow requests."
msgstr ""
"सर्वर जखन तक अखन इंटरनेट सँ जुड़ल अछि, निवेदन स्वीकार करब क' लेल बिन्यस्त नहि हाएत."

#: kio/global.cpp:771
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be running "
"the requested service (%1)."
msgstr ""
"सर्वर जखन तक वर्तमान मे इंटरनेट सँ जुड़ल अछि. निवेदित सेवा (%1) नहि चलाए रहल हाएत."

#: kio/global.cpp:773
msgid ""
"A network firewall (a device which restricts Internet requests), either "
"protecting your network or the network of the server, may have intervened, "
"preventing this request."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:780
msgid "Connection to Server Closed Unexpectedly"
msgstr "सर्वर सँ कनेक्शन अप्रत्याशित रूप सँ बन्न भए गेल"

#: kio/global.cpp:781
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Although a connection was established to <strong>%1</strong>, the connection "
"was closed at an unexpected point in the communication."
msgstr ""
"हालांकि <strong>%1</strong> पर कनेक्शन तँ बनाएल जाए चुकल छल, कनेक्शन संचार केर एकटा "
"अप्रत्याशित बिन्दु पर बन्न भ' गेल ."

#: kio/global.cpp:784
msgid ""
"A protocol error may have occurred, causing the server to close the "
"connection as a response to the error."
msgstr ""
"कोनो प्रोटोकाल त्रुटि भ' गेल हाएत, जकरासँ त्रुटिक प्रतिक्रिया स्वरूप सर्वर क' कनेक्शन बन्न "
"भ' गेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:790
msgid "URL Resource Invalid"
msgstr "यूआरएल संसाधन अवैध अछि"

#: kio/global.cpp:791
#, kde-format
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filter Protocol"
msgstr "प्रोटोकाल %1  एकटा फिल्टर प्रोटोकाल नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:792
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</"
"strong>ocator (URL) that you entered did not refer to a valid mechanism of "
"accessing the specific resource, <strong>%1%2</strong>."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:797
msgid ""
"KDE is able to communicate through a protocol within a protocol. This "
"request specified a protocol be used as such, however this protocol is not "
"capable of such an action. This is a rare event, and is likely to indicate a "
"programming error."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:805
msgid "Unable to Initialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr "इनपुट / आउटपुट अओजार इनिशियलाइज करब मे अक्षम"

#: kio/global.cpp:806
msgid "Could Not Mount Device"
msgstr "उपकरण माउन्ट नहि कए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:807
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be initialized (\"mounted\"). The reported "
"error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""
"निवेदित अओजार इनिशियलाइज़ (\"माउन्टेड\") नहि कएल जाए सकत. रिपोर्ट कएल गेल त्रुटि "
"अछि. <strong>%1</strong>"

#: kio/global.cpp:810
msgid ""
"The device may not be ready, for example there may be no media in a "
"removable media device (i.e. no CD-ROM in a CD drive), or in the case of a "
"peripheral/portable device, the device may not be correctly connected."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:814
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to initialize (\"mount\") the device. On UNIX "
"systems, often system administrator privileges are required to initialize a "
"device."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:818
msgid ""
"Check that the device is ready; removable drives must contain media, and "
"portable devices must be connected and powered on.; and try again."
msgstr ""
"जांचें जे अओजार तैआर अछि. हटाएल जाए सकैबला ड्राइव मे मीडिया होनाइ आओर पोर्टेबल उपकरण "
"कनेक्ट होनाइ चाही आओर पावर चालू होनाइ चाही, आओर फिनु सँ कोसिस करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:824
msgid "Unable to Uninitialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr "इनपुट / आउटपुट अओजार अनइनिशियलाइज करब मे अक्षम"

#: kio/global.cpp:825
msgid "Could Not Unmount Device"
msgstr "उपकरण अनमाउन्ट नहि कए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:826
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be uninitialized (\"unmounted\"). The "
"reported error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""
"निवेदित अओजार अनइनिशियलाइज़ (\"अनमाउन्टेड\") नहि कएल जाए सकत. रिपोर्ट कएल गेल त्रुटि "
"अछि: <strong>%1</strong>"

#: kio/global.cpp:829
msgid ""
"The device may be busy, that is, still in use by another application or "
"user. Even such things as having an open browser window on a location on "
"this device may cause the device to remain in use."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:833
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to uninitialize (\"unmount\") the device. On "
"UNIX systems, system administrator privileges are often required to "
"uninitialize a device."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:837
msgid "Check that no applications are accessing the device, and try again."
msgstr "जाँचू जे कोनो अनुप्रयोग अओजार केँ एक्सेस नकए रहल अछि. आओर फिनु सँ कोसिस करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:842
msgid "Cannot Read From Resource"
msgstr "संसाधन सँ पढ़ि नहि सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:843
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This means that although the resource, <strong>%1</strong>, was able to be "
"opened, an error occurred while reading the contents of the resource."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:846
msgid "You may not have permissions to read from the resource."
msgstr "अहाँक पास संसाधन सँ पढ़बाक अनुमति साइत नहि हाएत."

#: kio/global.cpp:855
msgid "Cannot Write to Resource"
msgstr "संसाधन पर लिखि नहि सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:856
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This means that although the resource, <strong>%1</strong>, was able to be "
"opened, an error occurred while writing to the resource."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:859
msgid "You may not have permissions to write to the resource."
msgstr "अहाँक पास संसाधन सँ लिखबाक अनुमति साइत नहि हाएत."

#: kio/global.cpp:868 kio/global.cpp:879
msgid "Could Not Listen for Network Connections"
msgstr "नेटवर्क कनेक्शन क' लेल सुन नहि सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:869
msgid "Could Not Bind"
msgstr "बाइंड नहि कए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:870 kio/global.cpp:881
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be established to listen for incoming "
"network connections."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:880
msgid "Could Not Listen"
msgstr "सुनि नहि सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:890
msgid "Could Not Accept Network Connection"
msgstr "नेटवर्क कनेक्शन स्वीकार नहि कए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:891
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which an error occurred while attempting "
"to accept an incoming network connection."
msgstr "ई पूरे तकनीकी त्रुटि अछि जकरामे आवक नेटवर्क कनेक्शनकेँ स्वीकारबाक कोसिस मे त्रुटि भेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:895
msgid "You may not have permissions to accept the connection."
msgstr "अहाँक पास कनेक्शन स्वीकारबाक अनुमति साइत नहि हाएत."

#: kio/global.cpp:900
#, kde-format
msgid "Could Not Login: %1"
msgstr " %1 पर लोगिन नहि कए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:901
msgid ""
"An attempt to login to perform the requested operation was unsuccessful."
msgstr "निवेदित आपरेशन निष्पादित करब क' लेल लोगिनक एकटा कोसिस असफल भेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:912
msgid "Could Not Determine Resource Status"
msgstr "संसाधन स्थिति निर्धारित नहि कए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:913
msgid "Could Not Stat Resource"
msgstr "संसाधन स्टेट नहि कए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:914
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An attempt to determine information about the status of the resource <strong>"
"%1</strong>, such as the resource name, type, size, etc., was unsuccessful."
msgstr ""
"संसाधन <strong>%1</strong> कए स्थिति केर संबंध मे जानकारी निर्धारित करबाक कोसिस, "
"जहिना जे संसाधन नाम, प्रकार, इत्यादि सफल नहि रहल."

#: kio/global.cpp:917
msgid "The specified resource may not have existed or may not be accessible."
msgstr "उल्लेखित संसाधन अथवा तँ उपलब्ध नहि अछि. अथवा फिनु पहुँच योग्य नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:925
msgid "Could Not Cancel Listing"
msgstr "लिस्टिंग रद नहि कए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:926
msgid "FIXME: Document this"
msgstr "FIXME: एकर दस्ताबेज बनाबू"

#: kio/global.cpp:930
msgid "Could Not Create Folder"
msgstr "फोल्डर बनाए नहि सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:931
msgid "An attempt to create the requested folder failed."
msgstr "निवेदित फोल्डर बनाबै की एकटा कोसिस असफल भेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:932
msgid "The location where the folder was to be created may not exist."
msgstr "स्थान जतए फोल्डर बनाएल जएनाइ अछि. साइत अस्तित्व मे नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:939
msgid "Could Not Remove Folder"
msgstr "फोल्डर नहि सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:940
#, kde-format
msgid "An attempt to remove the specified folder, <strong>%1</strong>, failed."
msgstr "उल्लेखित फोल्डर <strong>%1</strong> केँ मेटाबैक कोसिस असफल भेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:942
msgid "The specified folder may not exist."
msgstr "उल्लेखित फोल्डर अस्तित्व मे नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:943
msgid "The specified folder may not be empty."
msgstr "उल्लेखित फोल्डर साइत खाली नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:946
msgid "Ensure that the folder exists and is empty, and try again."
msgstr "सुनिश्चित करू जे फोल्डर मोजुद अछि. आओर फिनु सँ  कोसिस करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:951
msgid "Could Not Resume File Transfer"
msgstr "फाइल हस्तांतरण पुनरारंभ नहि कए सकत"

#: kio/global.cpp:952
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The specified request asked that the transfer of file <strong>%1</strong> be "
"resumed at a certain point of the transfer. This was not possible."
msgstr ""
"निर्दिष्ट निवेदन पूछलकाह जे फाइल <strong>%1</strong> क' ट्रांसफर केओ विशिष्ट बिन्दु से "
"रीज्यूम कएल जएनाइ चाही. ई संभव नहि अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:955
msgid "The protocol, or the server, may not support file resuming."
msgstr "प्रोटोकाल अथवा फाइल सर्वर साइत फाइल रिज़्यूमिंग समर्थित नहि कए सकैत अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:957
msgid "Retry the request without attempting to resume transfer."
msgstr "ट्रांसफर पुनरारंभ करब की कोसिस किए बगैर निवेदन फिनु सँ कोसिस करू"

#: kio/global.cpp:962
msgid "Could Not Rename Resource"
msgstr "संसाधन नाम बदएल नहि सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:963
#, kde-format
msgid "An attempt to rename the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "उल्लेखित संसाधन <strong>%1</strong> क' नाम बदलबाक कोसिस असफल भेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:971
msgid "Could Not Alter Permissions of Resource"
msgstr "संसाधन की अनुमतिसभ बदएल नहि सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:972
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An attempt to alter the permissions on the specified resource <strong>%1</"
"strong> failed."
msgstr "उल्लेखित संसाधन <strong>%1</strong> कए अनुमतिसभ  बदलबाक कोसिस असफल भेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:979
msgid "Could Not Change Ownership of Resource"
msgstr "रीसोर्स क' मालिकाना बदलल नहि जाए सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:980
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An attempt to change the ownership of the specified resource <strong>%1</"
"strong> failed."
msgstr "निर्दिष्ट संसाधन <strong>%1</strong> कए मालिकाना बदलबाक कोसिस असफल रहल."

#: kio/global.cpp:987
msgid "Could Not Delete Resource"
msgstr "संसाधन मेटाए नहि सकल"

#: kio/global.cpp:988
#, kde-format
msgid "An attempt to delete the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "उल्लेखित संसाधन <strong>%1</strong> केँ मेटाबैक कोसिस असफल भेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:995
msgid "Unexpected Program Termination"
msgstr " प्रोग्राम अप्रत्याशित बन्न"

#: kio/global.cpp:996
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol has unexpectedly terminated."
msgstr ""
"अहाँक कम्प्यूटर पर <strong>%1</strong> प्रोटोकाल पर पहुँच क' लेल संस्थापित प्रोग्राम "
"अप्रत्याशित रूप सँ बन्न भ' गेल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1004
msgid "Out of Memory"
msgstr "स्मृति कम"

#: kio/global.cpp:1005
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol could not obtain the memory required to continue."
msgstr ""
"अहाँक कम्प्यूटर पर <strong>%1</strong> प्रोटोकाल पर पहुँच स्थापित करब वाले प्रोग्राम मे "
"जारी रखबाक लायक वांछित मेमोरी प्राप्त नहि भए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1013
msgid "Unknown Proxy Host"
msgstr "अनचिन्ह प्राक्सी होस्ट"

#: kio/global.cpp:1014
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"While retrieving information about the specified proxy host, <strong>%1</"
"strong>, an Unknown Host error was encountered. An unknown host error "
"indicates that the requested name could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1018
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem with your network configuration, specifically "
"your proxy's hostname. If you have been accessing the Internet with no "
"problems recently, this is unlikely."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1022
msgid "Double-check your proxy settings and try again."
msgstr "अपन प्राक्सी सेटिंग दोबार जाँचू आओर फिनु सँ  कोसिस करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:1027
#, kde-format
msgid "Authentication Failed: Method %1 Not Supported"
msgstr "अनुमोदन असफल,  विधि %1  समर्थित नहि अछि"

#: kio/global.cpp:1029
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Although you may have supplied the correct authentication details, the "
"authentication failed because the method that the server is using is not "
"supported by the KDE program implementing the protocol %1."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1033
msgid ""
"Please file a bug at <a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">http://bugs.kde.org/</"
"a> to inform the KDE team of the unsupported authentication method."
msgstr ""
"असमर्थित प्रमाणीकरण विधि केर संबंध मे केडीई टोली केँ बताने क' लेल कृप्या <a href=\"http://"
"bugs.kde.org/\">http://bugs.kde.org/</a> पर बग रपट दर्ज करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:1039
msgid "Request Aborted"
msgstr "निवेदन रोकल गेल"

#: kio/global.cpp:1046
msgid "Internal Error in Server"
msgstr "सर्वर मे आंतरिक त्रुटि"

#: kio/global.cpp:1047
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The program on the server which provides access to the <strong>%1</strong> "
"protocol has reported an internal error: %2."
msgstr ""
"सर्वर मे <strong>%1</strong> प्रोटोकाल पर पहुँच प्रदान करब वाले प्रोग्राम ने आंतरिक "
"त्रुटि रपट देलक: %2."

#: kio/global.cpp:1050
msgid ""
"This is most likely to be caused by a bug in the server program. Please "
"consider submitting a full bug report as detailed below."
msgstr ""
"बेसी संभव अछि जे ई सर्वर प्रोग्राम मे बग केर कारण भेल अछि. कृप्या नीच्चाँ देल विवरण अनुसार "
"पूरा बग रपट जमा करू"

#: kio/global.cpp:1053
msgid "Contact the administrator of the server to advise them of the problem."
msgstr "समस्या केर संबंध मे परामर्श क' लेल सर्वर केर प्रशासक सँ सम्पर्क करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:1055
msgid ""
"If you know who the authors of the server software are, submit the bug "
"report directly to them."
msgstr "जँ अहाँ जानैत छी जे सर्वर साफ्टवेयर केर कओन लेखक अछि, तँ बग रपट ओकरा सीधे जमा करू."

#: kio/global.cpp:1060
msgid "Timeout Error"
msgstr "टाइम-आउट त्रुटि"

#: kio/global.cpp:1061
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Although contact was made with the server, a response was not received "
"within the amount of time allocated for the request as follows:"
"<ul><li>Timeout for establishing a connection: %1 seconds</li><li>Timeout "
"for receiving a response: %2 seconds</li><li>Timeout for accessing proxy "
"servers: %3 seconds</li></ul>Please note that you can alter these timeout "
"settings in the KDE Control Center, by selecting Network -> Preferences."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1072
msgid "The server was too busy responding to other requests to respond."
msgstr "आन निवेदनकेँ उत्तर देबामे सर्वर बेसी व्यस्त अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:1078
msgid "Unknown Error"
msgstr "अनजान त्रुटि"

#: kio/global.cpp:1079
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol has reported an unknown error: %2."
msgstr ""
"अहाँक कम्प्यूटर मे <strong>%1</strong> प्रोटोकाल पर पहुँच प्रदान करब वाले प्रोग्राम ने "
"एकटा अनचिन्ह त्रुटि रपट कएलक: %2."

#: kio/global.cpp:1087
msgid "Unknown Interruption"
msgstr "अनचिन्ह इंटरप्शन"

#: kio/global.cpp:1088
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol has reported an interruption of an unknown type: %2."
msgstr ""
"अहाँक कम्प्यूटर मे <strong>%1</strong> प्रोटोकाल पर पहुँच प्रदान करब वाले प्रोग्राम ने "
"एकटा अनचिन्ह इंटरप्शन रपट कएलक: %2."

#: kio/global.cpp:1096
msgid "Could Not Delete Original File"
msgstr "मूल फाइल मेटाए नहि सकैत अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:1097
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the deleting of the original file, most "
"likely at the end of a file move operation. The original file <strong>%1</"
"strong> could not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"निवेदित आपरेशन मूल फाइल केँ मेटाएब चाहैत अछि. बेसी संभव अछि फाइल घसकाबै केर अंतमे. मूल "
"फाइल <strong>%1</strong> मेटाएल नहि जाए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1106
msgid "Could Not Delete Temporary File"
msgstr "अस्थायी फाइल मेटाए नहि सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1107
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the creation of a temporary file in which "
"to save the new file while being downloaded. This temporary file <strong>%1</"
"strong> could not be deleted."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1116
msgid "Could Not Rename Original File"
msgstr "मूल फाइल क' नाम बदएल नहि सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1117
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the renaming of the original file <strong>%"
"1</strong>, however it could not be renamed."
msgstr ""
"निवेदित आपरेशन मूल फाइल <strong>%1</strong> क' नाम बदलब चाहैत अछि. मुदा ई नाम नहि "
"बदलल जाए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1125
msgid "Could Not Rename Temporary File"
msgstr "अस्थायी फाइल तैआर नहि कए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1126
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the creation of a temporary file <strong>%"
"1</strong>, however it could not be created."
msgstr ""
"निवेदित आपरेशन मे अस्थायी फाइल <strong>%1</strong> बनैनाइ आवश्यक अछि. मुदा ई बनाएल "
"नहि जाए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1134
msgid "Could Not Create Link"
msgstr "लिंक तैआर नहि कए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1135
msgid "Could Not Create Symbolic Link"
msgstr "सिंबालिक लिंक तैआर नहि कए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1136
#, kde-format
msgid "The requested symbolic link %1 could not be created."
msgstr "निवेदित सिंबालिक लिंक  %1 तैआर नहि कएल जाए सकल."

#: kio/global.cpp:1143
msgid "No Content"
msgstr "कोनो विषयवस्तु नहि"

#: kio/global.cpp:1148
msgid "Disk Full"
msgstr "डिस्क भरल"

#: kio/global.cpp:1149
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The requested file <strong>%1</strong> could not be written to as there is "
"inadequate disk space."
msgstr ""
"निवेदित फाइल <strong>%1</strong> लिखल नहि जाए सकल किएक डिस्क मे अपर्याप्त जगह अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:1151
msgid ""
"Free up enough disk space by 1) deleting unwanted and temporary files; 2) "
"archiving files to removable media storage such as CD-Recordable discs; or "
"3) obtain more storage capacity."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1158
msgid "Source and Destination Files Identical"
msgstr "स्रोत आओर गंतव्य फाइलसभ एकटा अछि"

#: kio/global.cpp:1159
msgid ""
"The operation could not be completed because the source and destination "
"files are the same file."
msgstr "आपरेशन पूरा नहि कएल जाए सकल किएक स्रोत आओर गंतव्य फाइल एकटा अछि."

#: kio/global.cpp:1161
msgid "Choose a different filename for the destination file."
msgstr "गंतव्य फाइल क' लेल पृथक नाम चुनू."

#: kio/global.cpp:1172
msgid "Undocumented Error"
msgstr "बिनु दस्ताबेज कएल त्रुटि"

#: kio/kemailsettings.cpp:251 kio/kemailsettings.cpp:254
#: kio/kemailsettings.cpp:261
msgid "Default"
msgstr "मूलभूत"

#: kio/krun.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>Unable to enter <b>%1</b>.\n"
"You do not have access rights to this location.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><b>%1</b> मे जएबामे अक्षम.\n"
"अहाँक पास एहि स्थान क' लेल पहुँच अधिकार नहि अछि.</qt>"

#: kio/krun.cpp:148
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>The file <b>%1</b> is an executable program. For safety it will not be "
"started.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>फाइल <b>%1</b> एकटा चलाबै लायक प्रोग्राम अछि. सुरक्षा क' लेल एकरा चलाएल नहि "
"जएताह.</qt>"

#: kio/krun.cpp:155
#, kde-format
msgid "<qt>You do not have permission to run <b>%1</b>.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>एकरा चलाबै क' लेल अहाँक अनुमति नहि अछि. <b>%1</b>.</qt> "

